<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic
  PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="directories-comparison-user-interface">
  <title>Compare Directories Tool Menus</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords><indexterm>Compare Directories tool<indexterm>Menus</indexterm></indexterm></keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_g3v_bgk_54b">The menus in the <uicontrol>Compare Directories</uicontrol> tool contain some of the same
      actions that are on the toolbar, as well as some common actions that are identical to the same
      actions in the <ph keyref="product"/> menus. The menu actions include:</p>
    <section id="file_menu">
      <title>File Menu</title>
      <p id="p_h3v_bgk_54b">
        <dl id="dl_i3v_bgk_54b">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_oyb_qmp_rkc234">
            <dt>Load XML Report</dt>
            <dd>Opens a dialog box where you can select a previously generated XML report file via
              the <uicontrol>Save Results as XML Report</uicontrol> action or via the <xref
                href="scripting-compare-directories.dita#scripting-compare-directories/section_gbd_tzb_vmb"
                >diff directories <codeph>-out xml/flo</codeph> scripting argument</xref>. If the
              report was produced on a different machine or from a different directory layout, you
              can remap the original directory paths to local equivalents. For more details, see
                <xref href="load-xml-comparison-report.dita">Load XML Report</xref>.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_hjv_lkp_rkc2">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/SaveXML20.png"/>Save Results as XML
                Report</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Saves the current directory comparison results as an XML report file. The report
              captures the full comparison tree (matching file pairs and their diff status), file
              comparison options, include/exclude filter patterns, and the comparison mode. You can
              later reload the saved report in the Compare Directories tool using the
                <uicontrol>Load XML Report</uicontrol> action (available from the
                <uicontrol>File</uicontrol> menu), without repeating the comparison.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="save_directory_result_html">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Save20.png" id="image_bnp_sfd_crb"/>Save Results as
                HTML</uicontrol>
            </dt>
            <dd>Generates an HTML file that contains detailed information about the comparison
                result.<ph product="author developer editor"> See an <xref
                  href="generate-html-report-for-directory-comparison.dita#generate-html-report-for-directory-comparison/p_jnw_hgx_5pb"
                  >example of what the generated report look like in the Generate HTML Report for
                  Directory Comparison topic</xref>.</ph></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_j3v_bgk_54b">
            <dt><uicontrol>Close (<shortcut
                  conkeyref="reusable-oxygen-shortcuts-list/ctrl_w_shortcut"/>)</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Closes the application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="compare_menu">
      <title>Compare Menu</title>
      <p id="p_k3v_bgk_54b">
        <dl id="dl_l3v_bgk_54b">
          <dlentry id="dir-perform-dir-diff">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/DiffPerform16.png"/>Perform Directories
                Differencing</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd><ph conkeyref="reusables-tools/perform-dir-diff-ph"/></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dir-perform-files-diff">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/DiffFiles16.png"/>Perform Files
                Differencing</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd><ph conkeyref="reusables-tools/compare-files-ph"/></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_m3v_bgk_54b">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/DiffCopyRightToLeft16.png"/>Copy Change from Right to
                Left</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd><ph conkeyref="reusables-tools/dir-copy-right-left-ph"/></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_n3v_bgk_54b">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/DiffCopyLeftToRight16.png"/>Copy Change from Left to
                Right</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd><ph conkeyref="reusables-tools/dir-copy-left-right-ph"/></dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="options_menu">
      <title>Options Menu</title>
      <p id="p_o3v_bgk_54b">
        <dl conkeyref="reusables-tools/options-dl" id="dl_p3v_bgk_54b">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_q3v_bgk_54b">
            <dt/>
            <dd/>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="help_menu">
      <title>Help Menu</title>
      <p id="p_r3v_bgk_54b">
        <dl conkeyref="reusables-tools/help-dl" id="dl_s3v_bgk_54b">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_t3v_bgk_54b">
            <dt/>
            <dd/>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
  </body>
